{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapstick Bosses is a heavily stylized boss fighting game, with a sole focus on gameplay and comedy. Explore the game's wacky world and all the outlandish humor it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss is completely unique, offering different playstyles throughout. What they do have in common is their 3 difficultys, ranging from challenging yet calm to blood-curdlingly difficult; as well as challenges for each, modified bosses that provide a new way to play each boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss defeat will earn you more of the game's currecy: <strong>Bits</strong>, which can be used to buy a plethora of cosmetics. The harder the difficulty, the more bits you'll earn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics come in the form of heads. Both swappable and stylish, these bad boys are always worth the price.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"the normal elevator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/065336427c90985a29ad1c71e5fe7bd50c9acbfe.jpg"},{"name":"dinner is served! (\u6a59\u8272\u9e21)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/192024ecf8f32c31bc3f0de998493273c1153fb0.jpg"},{"name":"pimple popper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/5c631c55921fba48e90e4443e2bdd831e7fc9c1a.jpg"},{"name":"green beam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/6c46b99a54d6bb8f4f1f6243ded225cb08f5989b.jpg"},{"name":"handicapable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/03017c65609dddb66ab162b2624671d7b09913ab.jpg"},{"name":"let it die! let it die! let it shrivel up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3082220/6e814158a670aeca3e6e8487af94bf4c48ad